er’s criteria in standard text book for clinical diagnosis)", "runs": [{"text": "As for acute osteomyelitis however this time sign and symptoms will be localized around the affected joint (refers Kocher’s criteria in standard text book for clinical diagnosis)"}]}, {"id": "body-18585", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18586", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Treat like acute osteomyelitis", "runs": [{"text": "Treat"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "like"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "acute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "osteomyelitis"}]}, {"id": "body-18588", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Surgical drainage", "runs": [{"text": "Surgical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "drainage"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18589", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Open surgery – incision and drainage followed by meticulous irrigation", "runs": [{"text": "Open"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "surgery"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "–"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "incision"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "drainage"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "followed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "meticulous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "irrigation"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1044"}}, {"id": "body-18590", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Arthroscopic joint drainage, debridement and washout with copious amount of normal saline", "runs": [{"text": "Arthroscopic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "joint"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "drainage,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "debridement"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "washout"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "copious"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "amount"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "normal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "saline"}